"Years later Nathan's Tutoring skill Developed into Veracity; the box read as below."
"\"Congratulations, you have developed the [Tutoring] utility skill into [Veracity].\""
"\"Utility skill: [Veracity]\""
"\"Your explanations now carry the weight of truth. Listeners will understand your explanations\""
"\"and feel that what you say must be accurate, even when they would normally not be persuaded.\""
"Nathan suspected Veracity took a devious form because he skipped details teaching an Insight."
"Later Parkour 10 Developed into Whiplash 1; the box read as below, without brackets."
"\"Congratulations, you have developed the Parkour skill into Whiplash!\""
"\"Utility skill: Whiplash\" / \"You can easily change the direction of your movement.\""
"Later Airwalking Developed into Skystride through an Insight about relativity; box below."
"\"Congratulations, you have developed the [Airwalking] Talent into [Skystride]\""
"\"Talent: [Skystride]\""
"\"You may spend Stamina to push off the air with any part of your body,\""
"\"gaining more speed than pure physical force would entail.\""
"\"You will also maintain velocity longer than inertia would imply.\""
"After clearing a blight, Nathan got five Development boxes at once, below."
"\"Congratulations, you have developed the [Arcane Insight] Talent into [The Truth of Magic].\""
"\"Utility skill: [The Truth of Magic]\" / \"You understand the truths of magic.\""
"\"Congratulations, you have developed the [Aura Control] utility skill into [Aura Mastery].\""
"\"Utility skill: [Aura Mastery]\" / \"Your Aura is enhanced in every way.\""
"\"Congratulations, you have developed the [Mental Vault] utility skill into [Wizard's Palace].\""
"\"Utility skill: [Wizard's Palace]\" / \"You carry your Tower of Solitude with you at all times.\""
"\"Your memory is perfect, your mental resources enhanced, and your mind's defenses impregnable.\""
"\"Congratulations, you have developed the [Mystical Discernment] utility skill into\""
"\"[The Sense of Magic].\" / \"Utility skill: The Sense of Magic\" / \"You can sense all forms of magic.\""
"\"Congratulations, you have developed the [Arcane Nullfield] Talent into [Magical Destruction].\""
"\"Talent: [Magical Destruction]\" / \"You destroy magic of every kind,\""
"\"and can extend this effect with an aura. Any power destroyed is converted into Stamina.\""
"In a later war, Tranquility 10 Developed into Perfected Mind 2 in a crisis; box below."
"\"Congratulations, you have developed the [Tranquility] utility skill into [Perfected Mind].\""
"\"Utility skill: [Perfected Mind]\" / \"Your mind obeys your will.\""
"Tranquility's text had been: \"Your mind will be calm and focused under all conditions,\""
"\"and your mind's eye is expanded.\""
"Later High-tier Disguise Developed into Blending through passive socializing; box below."
"\"Congratulations, you have developed the [High-tier Disguise] utility skill into [Blending].\""
"\"Utility skill: [Blending]\" / \"You will be at home in any social situation,\""
"\"able to avoid provoking annoyance or suspicion even in unfamiliar environments.\""
"High-tier Disguise had read: \"This skill will make your disguises more convincing,\""
"\"especially in conversation. You will seem less suspicious even in doubtful circumstances.\""
"At the great Conclave, Immortal Body 9 Developed into Distributed Immortality; box below."
"\"Congratulations, you have developed the [Immortal Body] Talent into [Distributed Immortality].\""
"\"Talent: [Distributed Immortality]\""
"\"Your physical form exists as a coordinated whole, and can be rebuilt from any speck of flesh\""
"\"as long as you have the resources to do so. You may restructure yourself at a minuscule scale,\""
"\"reunite severed parts, banish toxins, and resist aging at the cost of Stamina.\""
"\"Death requires total destruction and the depletion of both Stamina and Focus.\""
"Last, Magical Destruction 10 Developed into Davrar's Denial; box below."
"\"Congratulations, you have developed the [Magical Destruction] Talent into [Davrar's Denial].\""
"\"Talent: [Davrar's Denial]\" / \"You deny not only mana and wizardry, but also Davrar's core power,\""
"\"the deep magic that grants Classes, Skills, Levels, and Talents.\""
"\"You can deny all skills and Talents in addition to magic.\""
"\"Be warned that your own Davrar-granted power is not exempt.\""
"Nathan framed that last Insight as a request Davrar could grant or refuse."
"Then Inspiration 10 Developed into Mandate 1; the box wrongly called Inspiration a Talent."
"\"Congratulations, you have developed the [Inspiration] Talent into [Mandate].\""
"\"Utility skill: [Mandate]\" / \"Your words guide the minds of those who listen to you.\""
"\"Listeners remain free to disagree, but they must engage with your earnest intent.\""
"Mental Vault had earlier Developed to guard against mental effects and enhance memory."
"Stella's Talent Conduit of Mana Developed after she cast her first fusion spell."
"Aarl's Talent Spatial Blade, capped since Giantsrest, Developed into Dimensional Reach."
"Clearing the Helmaris blight granted the five Heirs bonus Developments."
